		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>Monstrous aquatic mix of crocodile, fish, and frog. Perpetually hungry, every joint has a fanged mouth.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 14, <strong>HP</strong> 54, <strong>ATK</strong> 2 bite +7 (1d12) or roar or trample, <strong>MV</strong> near (fly, swim), <strong>S</strong> +5, <strong>D</strong> +4, <strong>C</strong> +5, <strong>I</strong> +3, <strong>W</strong> +4, <strong>Ch</strong> +4, <strong>AL</strong> <strong>C</strong>, <strong>LV</strong> 11</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Great Being</strong>. Only damaged by silver or magical sources.</p><p></p><p><strong>Roar</strong>. All creatures who can hear within double near CON 15+ or panicked and deaf for 1d4 rounds.</p><p></p><p><strong>Trample</strong>. In place of attacks, move up to double near in a straight line and make 1 bite attack. If hit, x3 damage.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
